WEBVTT

00:00:00.144 --> 00:00:04.865
Apps group the routes you expose.

00:00:04.865 --> 00:00:10.026
Open the Developer Console and sign in with your console token.

00:00:10.026 --> 00:00:15.208
Create an app for a client, for example a partner API.

00:00:15.208 --> 00:00:20.269
Open the Default App and its Routes tab.

00:00:20.269 --> 00:00:23.216
Each route is a public method and path pointing at an integration.

00:00:23.216 --> 00:00:29.586
Add a route: first pick the integration.

00:00:29.586 --> 00:00:38.688
Then give it an id, a method and a path.

00:00:38.688 --> 00:00:41.094
The route appears in the list.

00:00:41.094 --> 00:00:45.350
Remember: an app serves traffic only if deployment.yaml mounts it.
